      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その前に控室に行って\r\n少しだけ打ち合わせをしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、わかったよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それから、みんなでの撮影が終わったら\r\n雑誌のインタビューがあるが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "聞いているよ\r\n確か『子どものころの思い出』がテーマだったね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ちゃんと受け答えも考えてきたから\r\n安心してくれていいよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすが咲耶。頼もしいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。アナタに褒めてもらえるなんて光栄だな",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だけど、私はアナタのアイドルだからね\r\nこのくらいは当然のことさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それで、インタビューが終わったら\r\n今日のお仕事は終わりでいいのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "se": "0544",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それから後は── っと、あれ",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと、控室は……ひとつ戻ったあっちか\r\nすまん、曲がり角を過ぎちゃったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、そうだったのかい？\r\nまったく気付かなかったよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、私もアナタも\r\n話をするのに夢中になっていたからかな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "す、すまん、つい……\r\nあ、もしかして、歩くのも速かったか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当にすまん、全然考えてなかった……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いや、そんなことはなかったよ\r\nだから、そんなに謝らないでほしい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、それならよかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……\r\n……あ、でも……そうだね……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした？\r\nやっぱり、もう少し合わせた方が……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いや、そういうわけじゃないんだ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ちょっと嬉しいな……と、思ってね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008110130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………話しながら歩こう\r\n止まっている余裕もないしね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600811/2006008110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……",
